:''Not to be confused with [[Gold Brick Cat (Special Cat)|Gold Brick Cat]] or [[Commander Cat (Special Cat)]].''
'''Gold Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 2.3 Update#Version 2.3.1 Update|Version 2.3.1]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]] increases health and grants [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Gold Cat can be unlocked in the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] after clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] in Chapter 2. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is only available when rolling in either [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|UBERFEST]] (SEA) or [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|SUPERFEST]] (JP/WW) banners.

